**Read:** [Water and Wastewater Treatment Engineering — MIT 1.85](../sources/Water-and-Wastewater-Treatment-Engineering-MIT.lingua#r_396YEC55H29CR6J4ZBZX5JBY60), lecture 13, with [Wastewater Characteristics, Treatment and Disposal — von Sperling](../sources/Wastewater-Characteristics-Treatment-and-Disposal.lingua#r_59N8AH8ZNEKJK3HC4J32RV50XC) and [Basic Principles of Wastewater Treatment — von Sperling](../sources/Basic-Principles-of-Wastewater-Treatment.lingua#r_083WF4FQEZQHB29YJBHWVZ0BEV); use [Manual de Saneamento — Funasa, fifth edition](../sources/Manual-de-Saneamento-Funasa.lingua#r_65G5YY3QVCA8HAXMPC8RTPKEWE) for Portuguese process terminology. Follow removed material to its handling and receiving route.

Screens protect downstream equipment by separating selected objects. Grit separation and primary settling target different physical behaviour. Primary treatment changes the organic and solids fractions presented to biology; it does not remove a universal fixed percentage under all flows. A reduction in liquid COD may correspond to more primary sludge requiring stabilization.

In an original mass-account example, 1,000 m³/day at 250 mg suspended solids/L carries 250 kg/day. A hypothetical 60% captured mass gives 150 kg/day of captured solids and 100 kg/day remaining. With a declared underflow volume of 10 m³/day, its solids concentration is 15 kg/m³, and the remaining 990 m³/day carries about 101.01 mg/L. Using the original inlet flow for both outlets would lose water consistency.

**Work:** Compare dry-weather and storm conditions using actual loads, separation evidence and hydraulic limits. Examine bypass and equipment unavailability. Develop a combined headworks/primary balance that includes screenings, grit, sludge water, wash water and returns. Explain how primary capture changes available carbon for downstream denitrification and anaerobic gas production.

**Continue:** [Activated sludge is a reactor and a separation system](Activated-sludge-is-a-reactor-and-a-separation-system.lingua#r_57AYPADG7XBVN45P200V6Y9ACT).
